+// Driven as a user drives it (Q12): opened through `Workspace::toggle_modal`, text set as the
+// query, an entry chosen with `Picker::set_selected_index`, then `menu::Confirm`; Escape is
+// `menu::Cancel`. Tags go through the real stores, so a write made inside a metadata-store update
+// panics here as it would in Zeo. Assumed seams, each named in ONE helper below:
+//   - `open_picker()`: `ThreadTagsPicker::new(thread_id, window, cx)` (task 4.1 Objective);
