+//   - `listed()`: the delegate's `test_entries() -> Vec<String>`, one string per match index:
+//     "+ Add tag “<text>”" (as typed, '#' stripped) · "[x] <display>" applied · "[ ] <display>";
+//   - `message()`: the delegate's `test_message() -> Option<SharedString>`, the line the picker
+//     shows (the store's rule or a refusal), `None` when nothing is shown.
