+// Hostile halves first: a different case of an existing tag ("RUST") offers no add (wrong split)
+// before a prefix of one ("rus") is new (wrong collapse); THIRD element: a tag only another thread
+// carries ("perl") is not new yet unapplied here; narrowing is a key substring ("trust" in,
+// fuzzy "rubyist" out); exactly ONE '#' is ignored ("##kiwi" is invalid); removing a tag here
